feat: i18n language routes + partner page + API directory engine

FIXED: Moved i18n prefix-stripping middleware BEFORE express.static so
language-prefixed URLs (/en/*, /ja/*, /kr/*) are properly rewritten
before static file lookup. Previous placement after static caused
404s because Express served its own 404 before reaching the middleware.

NEW ENDPOINTS:
- GET /partner — B2B partnership landing page (3-tier pricing)
- GET /api/partner/info — structured JSON with plans & contact info
- GET /en/*, /ja/*, /kr/* — language-prefixed routes for SEO

INFRASTRUCTURE:
- lib/i18n.js: Translation engine with EN/JP/KR support
- config/translations.json: Core UI strings in 4 languages
- scripts/api-directory-submit.js: Prepares API marketplace listings
- sitemap.xml: Added hreflang links + /partner entry

VERIFICATION: Service active, all core endpoints 200.
